# The safe area (docs/safe-area-plan.md A3, §5): the picture bleeds past the
# window's inset and the bars at the top, the canvas at the bottom, and the
# widgets between them stay inside the safe area, at the default inset and at 0.
expect_title "safearea"
expect_safe image@picture bleeds
expect_safe label@caption
expect_safe button@inset
expect_safe canvas@ground bleeds
# A bled canvas keeps its size: it is drawn at the bled size, and a slot that
# passed that size up grew every frame (docs/traps.md).
settle 700
expect_safe canvas@ground bleeds
expect_inset 16
click button@inset
expect label@caption "inset 0"
expect_inset 0
expect_safe image@picture bleeds
expect_safe label@caption
expect_safe canvas@ground bleeds
